# Character-select services: everything a session with charid == None can ask
# for. Taken from the order the real V24.01 client issues them in
# /tmp/evejs-session.pcap, so every line here is a call some server has
# answered for a real client at this point in the session.
#
#   probe run --script crates/eve-probe/scripts/charsel.probe --out <dir>

note stage 4a: what the proxy advertises
call machoNet.GetServiceInfo
call machoNet.GetTime

note stage 4b: the config service, which is the static-data cache
call config.GetBlackListedPlanets
call config.GetOldStationData
call config.GetAverageMarketPrices
call config.GetMultiOwnersEx [1]
call config.GetMultiLocationsEx [60003760]

note stage 4c: the character list and what hangs off it
call charUnboundMgr.GetCharacterSelectionData
call charUnboundMgr.GetCohortsForUser
call charUnboundMgr.GetNumCharacters
call charUnboundMgr.GetQAStarterSystemIDs
call charUnboundMgr.GetValidRandomName 1

note stage 4d: account, store and campaign state
call account.GetCashBalance 0
call subscriptionMgr.GetCloneGrade
call raffleProxy.AmIBanned
call userSvc.GetRedeemTokens
call loginCampaignManager.get_client_campaign_state
call seasonalLoginCampaignManager.get_active_campaign
call air_npe.is_air_npe_enabled

note stage 4e: the market, which only a server can author
call marketProxy.StartupCheck
call marketProxy.GetRegionBest 10000002
call marketProxy.GetOrders 10000002, 34
call marketProxy.GetNewPriceHistory 10000002, 34
call marketProxy.GetOldPriceHistory 10000002, 34

note stage 4f: agents, standings and the map
call agentMgr.GetAgents
call standingMgr.GetNPCNPCStandings
call standingMgr.GetCharStandings
call map.GetSecurityModifiedSystems
call securityMgr.get_modified_systems
call stationSvc.GetAllianceSystems
call structureDirectory.GetStructureMapData

note stage 4g: drain anything that follows
drain 4000
